{"id":"sirviente","lemma":"sirviente","pos":"adj","rank":3846,"glosses":["that serves"],"ipa":"/siɾˈbjente/","forms":{"femininePlural":"sirvientes"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/48/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Emanuelps27-sirviente.wav","examples":[{"text":"El sirviente barrió el suelo.","en":"The servant swept the floor.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,null,{"g":"the"},{"g":"dirt"}]},{"text":"Quiero contratar a un sirviente.","en":"I want to hire a servant.","words":[{"g":"to desire","l":"querer"},{"g":"to contract"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Los sirvientes trabajaban como hormigas.","en":"The servants worked like ants.","words":[{"g":"the / them"},null,{"g":"to work","l":"trabajar"},{"g":"as"},{"g":"ant","l":"hormiga"}]},{"text":"Los perros tienen amos, los gatos, sirvientes.","en":"Dogs have masters. Cats have servants.","words":[{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"dog","l":"perro"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"master","l":"amo"},{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"cat","l":"gato"},null]},{"text":"Tom hizo que sus sirvientes comieran a oscuras.","en":"Tom made his servants eat in the dark.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/801959","words":[null,{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"his, her, its, their"},null,{"g":"to eat","l":"comer"},null,null],"phrases":[[6,8,"in the dark"]]}]}